     7	/**
     8	 * As the name indicates, this is a simple server class. Once started, it opens a TCP-socket for clients to connect
     9	 * as well as an (optional) UDP datagram socket (if possible) that broadcasts this server's ip and port for allowing
    10	 * to implement a simple server browser.<br>
