    42	     * @param tcpPort The tcp port to which a client can connect with this server. This port has to be open and unused or otherwise, the server won't start.
    43	     * @param udpPort the udp port for broadcasting the server's ip and port (and player count). If this port is not available, the broadcasting thread will
    44	     * terminate, but the server will run anyway.
